# Aegis fix catalog #080 — Artifact upload path differs from the build output directory
#
# Tier:       3 · Intermediate
# Category:   artifact_failure (auto-diagnosed from the log below)
# Engine:     deterministic rule engine — no AI involved
#
# CI log:
#   | Warning: No files were found with the provided path: dist/. No artifacts will be uploaded.
#   | Error: artifact not found
#
# How it is solved:
#   MODIFY .github/workflows/ci.yml
#     - Pointed upload-artifact at the directory the build actually writes: dist/ → lib/ (job "build") — the build tool's own config sets that output directory, so the old path was always empty
#
# Apply:      git apply 03-intermediate/080-artifact_failure.diff
diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -29,4 +29,4 @@
       - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
         with:
           name: dist
-          path: dist/
+          path: lib/
